## Data model

```kotlin
data class SurveyRecord(
    val id: String,
    val fieldWorkerId: String,
    val locationLat: Double,
    val locationLng: Double,
    val answersJson: String,
    val createdAt: Long,
    val syncStatus: SyncStatus = SyncStatus.PENDING
)

enum class SyncStatus {
    PENDING,
    SYNCED,
    FAILED
}
