## API client

This is a simple Retrofit-style interface. Your backend would expose an endpoint for sync.

```kotlin
data class SurveyRecordDto(
    val id: String,
    val fieldWorkerId: String,
    val locationLat: Double,
    val locationLng: Double,
    val answersJson: String,
    val createdAt: Long
)

fun SurveyRecordEntity.toDto(): SurveyRecordDto = SurveyRecordDto(
    id = id,
    fieldWorkerId = fieldWorkerId,
    locationLat = locationLat,
    locationLng = locationLng,
    answersJson = answersJson,
    createdAt = createdAt
)

interface SurveyApi {
    suspend fun submitSurvey(record: SurveyRecordDto): SyncResponse
}

data class SyncResponse(
    val success: Boolean,
    val message: String? = null
)
```

