## 4) Sync service

This service pushes local unsynced records when online.

```dart
class SurveySyncService {
  final SurveyLocalStore localStore;
  final SurveyApiClient apiClient;

  SurveySyncService({
    required this.localStore,
    required this.apiClient,
  });

  Future<void> syncPendingSurveys() async {
    final unsynced = await localStore.getUnsyncedSurveys();

    for (final survey in unsynced) {
      try {
        await apiClient.uploadSurvey(survey);
        await localStore.markSynced(survey.id);
      } catch (e) {
        // Stop or continue depending on your retry strategy
        print('Sync failed for ${survey.id}: $e');
      }
    }
  }
}
```

