## 5) Connectivity listener

Using `connectivity_plus` to trigger sync when connection returns.

```dart
import 'dart:async';
import 'package:connectivity_plus/connectivity_plus.dart';

class ConnectivitySyncManager {
  final SurveySyncService syncService;
  StreamSubscription? _subscription;

  ConnectivitySyncManager({required this.syncService});

  void startListening() {
    _subscription = Connectivity().onConnectivityChanged.listen((result) async {
      if (result != ConnectivityResult.none) {
        await syncService.syncPendingSurveys();
      }
    });
  }

  void dispose() {
    _subscription?.cancel();
  }
}
```

