5. Set `RLIMIT_AS`, `RLIMIT_DATA`, and `RLIMIT_CORE` in a wrapper or service unit.
6. Use `prctl(PR_SET_DUMPABLE, 0)` on Linux if needed.
7. Consider an event-driven redesign if polling becomes too costly.

